From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pingcheck: publish authoritative native uplink state

Resolve ordered logical-interface aliases using current netifd status, preserve
unknown and pending states, and invalidate probes before deferred status queries.
Publish status changes over ubus and expose the selected interface and family.
Initialize timers before any state publication; an empty probe set is unknown.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

